    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6fea9d9499bd06bdceb067",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『腿部有疼痛』，西沙里奥这样告诉我。\n我带她去了医院……被告知了这样的检查结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85b707a5e4518f9dcf04282b96bbc0368d453e98159857b24feb96180bfa8a17",
