      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时间停止了。我和莱茵力量像被冻住了一样\n纹丝不动。但……西沙里奥却对我们温柔地笑着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5404bf3cdf136e8bd51975673cbc981e849899b37b4b1891920e0b3d3f75c060",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
