      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然我也很想奔跑。但是当我认识到这个伤能否痊愈\n是个未知数，考虑了未来的打算时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b3bf38dfed19dc321479beb8c394cf53c6110955ab6b81d692d7ba243583437",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
